{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Story Background </h2>Your friend Atoo believes in exchanging sincerity for sincerity in love, always giving and pleasing girls unconditionally. However, the result is either being rejected or deceived by a scumbag, being drained of money by a woman, and being injured. He suddenly awakens and begins to seek advice on flirting skills from you. Under your words and deeds, he gradually understands the law of love. However, to your surprise, he slowly  transforms into a top-notch scumbag. The women he plays with are all hurt and even commited succide. In order to retaliate and punish him, these victimized girls and their families unite to cast Atoo into an illusory world. In the cyberspace, you bravely entered this space to save your friends. Unexpectedly, the women you met here were all your girlfriends, In this dangerous and eerie cyber city, there is an extremely terriable law that constantly puts you to the test of life and death...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Main character </h2>Happy, in reality, she is your current girlfriend<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109980/extras/90a40936c172e40e4ec92826fbdbd4af.poster.avif?t=1730377984\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109980/extras/90a40936c172e40e4ec92826fbdbd4af.webm?t=1730377984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109980/extras/90a40936c172e40e4ec92826fbdbd4af.mp4?t=1730377984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Mumu, your ex girlfriend (actually just had a few meals with you and watched two movies)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109980/extras/a7eb982bbbc030c18faf9e3b3f8